# Ubuntu 26.04 (resolute) amd64 packages for the guest initrd.
# busybox-initramfs 1:1.37.0-7ubuntu1 is the testnet BusyBox. It provides
# sh, mkdir, mount, ip, grep, wget, pidof, tail, and sleep.
# blkid, ipconfig, and kmod are separate programs.
# libgcc-s1 and libstdc++6 are for the Rust binaries. The kernel package is not in this list.
